			"notes": "Version 26.08.307 (Beta / Pre-release)\n\nThis is a pre-release containing major performance improvements, security enhancements, and community contributions.\n\nPerformance Fixes:\n- Star Frustum Culling: Optimized space stars rendering to prevent camera rotation lag.\n- Double Rendering Fix: Resolved an issue where space stars were rendered twice at night.\n- Planet Beneath View: The Earth/ground view above 1000m now bypasses config checks.\n\nConfig Changes:\n- Custom Sky default state: The custom sky option (enableCustomSky) is now disabled by default.\n\nSecurity Fixes:\n- Restricted /rn limit_world_border to operators (permission level 2+).\n- Restricted /sable to operators (permission level 2+).\n\nMerged Pull Requests:\n- PR #97: Sputnik Flight Computer multiplayer UI state preservation.\n- PR #101: Simplified Chinese (zh_cn.json) localization updates."
		},
