			"notes": "Added:\n- Sputnik audio synthesizer engine and Lua script wrapper\n- Client-side custom synthesizer and playback payload\n- Overworld custom sun and moon coordinate/distance fixes to prevent culling\n- Vanilla-accurate ZP sky rotation and day time alignment\n- World size limit warning prompt shown on first world join\n- Clickable Da/Net chat components to run world border lock packet (limits to 40,000 blocks)\n- Creative Rocket Thruster that operates solely on Redstone signals\n- Mapped creative thruster to a unique purple/magenta exhaust plume color\n- Space helmet item tooltip localized translations in English, Russian, and Chinese\n- Custom main menu splash screen texts\n- Corrected creative thruster block model texture namespace and render layer (cutout_mipped)"
		},
